  "id": "english-muffin-hors-d-oeuvres",
  "name": "English Muffin Hors d’Oeuvres",
  "subtitle": "Warm cheese-topped muffin bites",
  "description": "Split English muffins are covered with a savory cheddar and mayonnaise mixture, then grilled until hot and lightly browned.",
  "meal_type": "baked-good",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "yield": {
